  ('Gary Spencer', 'Luxulyan A', 'Team Captain', -5, 'playing', '{"hand":"Right","started":"15 - Because I wasn''t allowed to play earlier at Bugle WMC at that time.","first_memory":"Losing on the black in my first ever league game in the Ree''s League when stepping in last minute to make up the numbers","highest_break":"Solo practice 145 (On video at Bugle Club witnessed on video but never recieved the footage!)140 Total Clearance vs an opponent, 122 Total Clearance and x3 Matchplay tons 101, 102 & 106 to date. Nationals Highest for Cornwall 89.","achievement":"3 x Matchplay tons (102 in 2009 League match and two in 2025/26 season, one in the county dbls semi-final (101) and the other in the East vs West away leg (106 ). , beating Andy hicks in an exhibition, 140TC vs Andrew Best in practice, making 145 in solo practice, representing Cornwall in the Nationals in 2025/26 season (Team highest break 89), County Team & Doubles trophies (x 2) , Victory League seasons 2009 & 2018/19 winning multiple trophy''s from team ones, to dbls and individuals along with many successful seasons in between. Winning the County Highest break Trophy 25/26 (101). Winning the league rankings twice, St Blazey & District League Snooker Shootout winner x 2 from two..","ambition":"A 147, League Singles (x2 finalist) & County Singles (x 2 Semi-Finalist only 1 ball away from the final the 1st time).","memorable_match":"Ronnie v Higgins when Higgins won by a single frame when Ronnie was playing sublime and Higgins not only matched him but won the final. Unsure on the year, but remember watching it till the end!","favourite_pro":"Ronnie","commentator":"Joe Perry/Hendry","famous_met":"Ronnie, Judd, Mark Williams (met) and luckily plenty more","bogey":"Don''t really have one","best_player":"Darren Lock/Me/Andrew Best","underrated":"Garry Stephens","funniest":"Mo climbing under the matchtable whilst a game was in progress to get his ball back from the 2nd table. Only Mo!"}'::jsonb, null),
